    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="n63bcb614e979492bafa4c52ada91c185b66"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/Tenure"/>
    <skos:broadMatch rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E4_Period"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Dated period during which an actor (typically a Guthi) holds custody of a heritage structure or object, opened and closed by transfer-of-custody events. Unlike the untimed crm:P50i_is_current_keeper_of, it answers who held custody at a given date.</skos:definition>
    <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">Design note: PROV placement: a prov:Entity, i.e. a thing whose provenance is tracked (sources, attributions, assertions about it), and a crm:E4_Period (stated, 1.1.0). A period is not a crm:E7_Activity, so the class stays outside any E7 ⊑ prov:Activity alignment and the PROV-O Entity/Activity disjointness is not engaged; reasoning with CIDOC-CRM, CRMinf, CRMsci and PROV-O loaded is consistent with the example data.</skos:editorialNote>
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/schema"/>
  </rdf:Description>
