    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://purl.org/dc/terms/accessRights"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Cultural access protocol for the thing or its record (e.g. restricted to initiates, secret or sacred, seasonal), set with the community concerned; a subproperty of dcterms:accessRights. Data under a restriction should not be published.</skos:definition>
